  "description": "Ure, who remained unmarried at twenty-five—claiming she simply had never met a man who suited her—lived quietly with her mother.\n\nOne day, she hears a startling rumor: the only cure for her mother’s illness is “the Imugi’s horn that lengthens and shortens.”\n\nA faint sound escaped from Hyeon-o’s lips, a soft, moist, trembling moan.\n\nUre’s sun-kissed cheeks flushed red.\n\nShe swallowed hard.\n\n“They say that the Imugi’s horn—able to grow and contract at will—is incredibly beneficial to the human body…”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/imugi), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/imugi_half), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14601410) \n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[German](https://www.lezhinde.com/detail/dad_2000549)",
